## Appendix: Kernel Arguments Explained

| Argument | Purpose | Required For |
|----------|---------|--------------|
| `nouveau.modeset=0` | Disables open-source nouveau driver | All NVIDIA GPU passthrough |
| `nvidia-drm.modeset=1` | Enables NVIDIA Direct Rendering Manager | Container GPU access |
| `pci=realloc` | Forces PCI resource reallocation | Xen/XCP-ng hypervisors |

**All three arguments are mandatory for GPU passthrough on XCP-ng.**

